# Agent capture

This repo logs Agent prompts and final responses automatically via Cursor hooks in `.cursor/hooks.json`.

- Do not add `.agent-logs/` to `.gitignore`. The logs ship with the repo.
- Do not edit, tidy, summarise, or delete entries in `.agent-logs/` after they are written.
- Do not wrap sessions in a manual logger. Capture is the `beforeSubmitPrompt` and `afterAgentResponse` hooks running `.cursor/hooks/capture.cmd`.
